saturated|PASS: Completely wet is the only supplied 4600 boundary. Solutions, fats and colour are explicitly separated rather than assigned unsupported scientific Senses; the leaking-tap cloth example matches thấm đẫm.
widen|PASS: Physical pavement width and time gap are distinct source-supported boundaries. Both transitive and intransitive patterns are checked; the Vietnamese temporal phrase avoids treating departure spacing as road width.
adapt|PASS: Person adjusting, creative-work conversion and object modification keep three source ordinals and different complements. Radio adaptation, earlier starts and carpentry examples preserve their object and purpose in Vietnamese.
foundation|PASS: Building support, developmental basis and funding organisation are kept distinct. The archive example makes no financial-law claim; plural foundations and proper-name capitalization are useful qualified grammar guidance.
inequality|PASS: Social/resource inequality is separated from mathematical notation. The survey's topic does not assert a measured disparity; singular/plural guidance and access-to-transport translation are coherent.
